    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🧠 QDRANT EMBEDDING SYNC\n\n**What Happens:**\nThis workflow rebuilds the semantic search index for all supported F&O stocks.\n\n1. **Trigger:** Called from the Master Data Sync workflow after instrument_master is refreshed.\n2. **Reset Qdrant:** Completely deletes the existing `stock_symbols` collection so there are no stale vectors.\n3. **Load Instruments:** Reads `token, symbol, name, exchange, search_terms` from `instrument_master` in Postgres.\n4. **Build Documents:** Python node combines symbol, full name, exchange, token and search_terms into a single search-friendly text field per stock.\n5. **Chunk & Embed:** Text loader + smart splitter create chunks when needed, then Ollama generates dense embeddings using the `embeddinggemma:300m` model.\n6. **Upsert to Qdrant:** All embeddings with their metadata are written into the `stock_symbols` collection via the Qdrant Vector Store node.\n7. **Notification:** Final Python node counts how many instruments were processed and sends a Telegram message confirming how many embeddings were created.\n\n**Output:** Fresh, fully rebuilt Qdrant collection for `stock_symbols`, ready for fast typo‑tolerant and alias‑aware stock search.",
        "height": 992,
        "width": 1968,
        "color": 7
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
